cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Parallax Anything in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Parallax Anything: turn any photo into a cinematic 3D camera move"
authors:
  - name: "working-codes-demo"
    website: "https://github.com/working-codes-demo"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-22
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/working-codes-demo/parallax-anything"
url: "https://github.com/working-codes-demo/parallax-anything"
abstract: >-
  Turns a single photo into a 3D parallax video: monocular depth, layered
  rendering with occlusion inpainting, seven camera moves, depth of field and
  seamless loops. Runs on CUDA, Apple Silicon or CPU.
keywords:
  - depth estimation
  - 3D photo
  - parallax
  - novel view synthesis
  - video generation
